# VHS Tape for Sweeper Demo
# Install VHS: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Run: vhs demo.tape

Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "python sweeper.py"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 2s
Type "1"
Sleep 800ms
Enter

Sleep 800ms
Type "y"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 3s
